Hi {Owner},

I build websites for small law firms around {City}. {Business Name} has a good local name, but no site of its own where someone can read about the attorney, see the fees and request a consultation quietly.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a consultation request with a conflict check, a process timeline for your main practice area, a first-meeting document checklist and an attorney advertising disclaimer for you to edit, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you'd like it, I move it to a domain your firm owns and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and edits. You approve every page before it publishes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
